        "media_aspect_ratio_desktop": "taller",
        "media_fullwidth_mobile": false,
        "media_caption": "",
        "content": "<p>We’re excited to announce that we’ve partnered with The NOW to create the new, limited-edition JET LAG massage—a full-body Swedish-inspired massage featuring a custom Gua Sha enhancement for the hands and feet using our award-winning <a href=\"/products/jet-lag-mask\" target=\"_blank\" title=\"Jet Lag Mask\">Jet Lag Mask</a> and moisturizer.</p><h2>What is the JET LAG massage?</h2><p>Created with summer travel in mind, this 50 or 80-minute NOW massage is perfect pre-flight, post-travel, or for anyone in need of a hydrating, full-body reset. Your massage therapist will soothe tired legs and treat neck and shoulder tension, promoting total relaxation. </p><p>For added relief, the JET LAG massage includes a custom Gua Sha treatment for hands and feet using our best-selling <a href=\"/products/jet-lag-mask\" target=\"_blank\" title=\"Jet Lag Mask\">Jet Lag Mask</a> and moisturizer, known for its ultra-hydrating formula and ability to calm tired, dull skin. The multi-tasking combination of niacinamide, glycerin, hyaluronic acid and antioxidants work together to deliver deep, soothing hydration. Used with The NOW’s Rose Quartz Gua Sha tool, it can help reduce inflammation, improve circulation and promote lymphatic drainage. </p>",
